flowchart LR
  G[Guest browser] --> P[Public marketplace]
  M[Authenticated member] --> P
  P --> A[Supabase Auth]
  M --> W[React member workspace]
  W --> DB[(Supabase Postgres and RLS)]
  W --> ST[Private and public Storage buckets]
  W --> RT[Realtime channels]
  AD[Admin and Super Admin] --> C[Control panel]
  C --> DB
  C --> ST
  DB --> N[Notifications]
  N --> W
  DB --> O[Orders, matches, reviews]
  DB --> PAY[Payment proofs and payout records]
  PAY --> C
  O --> RT
